{"id":30296,"mal_id":30296,"title":"Rakudai Kishi no Cavalry","englishTitle":"Chivalry of a Failed Knight","title_english":"Chivalry of a Failed Knight","alternative_titles":{"synonyms":["A Chivalry of the Failed Knight","Rakudai Kishi no Eiyuutan","A Tale of Worst One"],"en":"Chivalry of a Failed Knight","ja":"落第騎士の英雄譚"},"synopsis":"There exist few humans in this world with the ability to manipulate their souls to form powerful weapons. Dubbed \"Blazers,\" these people study and train at the prestigious Hagun Academy to become Mage-Knights; among the students is so-called failure Ikki Kurogane, the sole F-rated Blazer. However, when the worst student in the academy sees Stella Vermillion, an A-ranked Blazer who also happens to be a princess, naked, she challenges him to a duel with dire stakes—the loser becomes the slave of the winner. There's no possible way that Stella can lose, right?\n\nAs he tries to prove his strength to a world that believes him to be the weakest, Ikki gains new friends, wisdom, and experience.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]","synopsis_es":"Existen pocos humanos en este mundo con la capacidad de manipular sus almas para formar armas poderosas. Apodados \"Blazers\", estas personas estudian y se entrenan en la prestigiosa Academia Hagun para convertirse en Mage-Knights; Entre los estudiantes se encuentra el llamado fracaso Ikki Kurogane, el único Blazer con calificación F. Sin embargo, cuando el peor estudiante de la academia ve desnuda a Stella Vermillion, una Blazer de rango A que también es una princesa, lo desafía a un duelo con riesgos terribles: el perdedor se convierte en esclavo del ganador. No hay forma posible de que Stella pueda perder, ¿verdad?\n\nMientras intenta demostrar su fuerza ante un mundo que cree que él es el más débil, Ikki gana nuevos amigos, sabiduría y experiencia.\n\n[Escrito por MAL Rewrite]","type":"TV","media_type":"tv","status":"finished_airing","averageEpisodeDurationSeconds":1420,"average_episode_duration":1420,"s